#: ../../source/docs/modules/nmeagps.rst:3 fddc7cbfdaf64647ba50c552aa282049
msgid "NMEA GPS Input"
msgstr "NMEA GPS 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/nmeagps.rst:9 83045744ad744451a342e86b15efc2a3
msgid ""
"Parses and displays the position of a NMEA GPS connected via COM port. The "
"position is *not* sent to ArduPilot."
msgstr "解析并显示通过 COM 端口连接的 NMEA GPS 的位置。该位置 *不会* 发送给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/nmeagps.rst:12 df40e10600314b8f808c7ee703298dda
msgid "This module requires the ``pynmea2`` Python package to be installed."
msgstr "该模块需要安装 ``pynmea2`` Python 包。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/nmeagps.rst:14 547bb2b6c14d473d89b214aab9470a0e
msgid ""
"Use ``nmeagps connect`` to connect to the NMEA GPS module and ``nmeagps "
"disconnect`` to disconnect from the module."
msgstr "使用 ``nmeagps connect`` 连接 NMEA GPS 模块，``nmeagps disconnect`` 断开连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/nmeagps.rst:17 fc79af2df31f431d9e162f31b7669f03
msgid ""
"To see the current position reported by the NMEA GPS module, use ``nmeagps "
"status``."
msgstr "使用 ``nmeagps status`` 查看 NMEA GPS 模块当前报告的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/nmeagps.rst:19 d4284bc5a6c04c3e8c0523c1942ec09c
msgid ""
"The module has the following settings, which via be set via ``nmeagps set``."
msgstr "该模块具有以下设置，可通过 ``nmeagps set`` 进行配置。"

